":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":87,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":43,"end":70,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-69235cc8602e071795fd","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-14e81f2c7c0e488327c7","layer":"original","quote":"其余党与，皆赦之，使复其居业","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":87,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":127,"end":141,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-6ab1e9aaca52ff1df056","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-dbcc0741c034bfee7b5b","layer":"original","quote":"固等使兵数千人绝陕津〖1〗，畿至，不得渡","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":85,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":20,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-6fc011d0311d47d96ae9","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-dbcc0741c034bfee7b5b","layer":"original","quote":"太祖遣夏侯惇讨之，未至","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":85,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":21,"end":32,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-731e737babc63ea9a444","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-712df71ce4cf5c21e401","layer":"original","quote":"以固为都督，行丞事〖12〗，领功曹；将校吏兵三千余人，皆范先督之","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":86,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":57,"end":89,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-7541709a6f05cc964694","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-dbcc0741c034bfee7b5b","layer":"original","quote":"畿举动自若。于是固曰：“杀之无损，徒有恶名；且制之在我。”遂奉之","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":85,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":252,"end":284,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-839df869e15e162a3b26","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-dbcc0741c034bfee7b5b","layer":"original","quote":"范先欲杀畿以威众，﹝二﹞且观畿去就〖8〗，于门下斩杀主簿以下三十余人","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":85,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":217,"end":251,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-9c2058f75cb430f2cc42","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-712df71ce4cf5c21e401","layer":"original","quote":"固欲大发兵〖14〗；畿患之，说固曰：“夫欲为非常之事，不可动众心。今大发兵，众必扰；不如徐以赀募兵〖15〗。”固以为然，从之；遂为赀调发，数十日乃定；诸将贪，多应募而少遣兵","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":86,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":108,"end":194,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-a1ab48fde1c8313d4c63","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-18fc621e57fb0ca723bc","layer":"original","quote":"太祖谓荀彧曰：“关西诸将，恃险与马〖9〗，征必为乱。张晟寇崤、渑间，南通刘表；固等因之，吾恐其为害深。河东被山带河，四邻多变，当今天下之要地也。君为我举萧何、寇恂以镇之〖10〗。”彧曰：“杜畿其人也","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":67,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":94,"end":193,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-a9a2d7abf4ceba4acd22","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-14e81f2c7c0e488327c7","layer":"original","quote":"吏民多举城助畿者，比数十日，得四千余人","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":87,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":71,"end":90,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-b05f74775f00a7994b85","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-dbcc0741c034bfee7b5b","layer":"original","quote":"或谓畿曰：“宜须大兵〖2〗。”畿曰：“河东有三万户，非皆欲为乱也。今兵迫之急，欲为善者无主，必惧而听于固；固等势专〖3〗，必以死战。讨之不胜，四邻应之，天下之变未息也；讨之而胜，是残一郡之民也。且固等未显绝王命〖4〗，外以请故君为名〖5〗，必不害新君〖6〗。吾单车直往，出其不意；固为人多计而无断，必伪受吾。吾得居郡一月，以计縻之，足矣","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":85,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":33,"end":201,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-b0f8cbec6f133fec76e5","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-712df71ce4cf5c21e401","layer":"original","quote":"又入喻固等曰：“人情顾家。诸将掾吏，可分遣休息，急缓召之不难〖17〗。”固等恶逆众心〖18〗，又从之。于是善人在外，阴为己援；恶人分散，各还其家：则众离矣","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":86,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":199,"end":276,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-b29d927d6d43065dbf63","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-14e81f2c7c0e488327c7","layer":"original","quote":"会大兵至，幹、晟败，固等伏诛","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":87,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":112,"end":126,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-f3a6e24f1fd948be6c18","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-dbcc0741c034bfee7b5b","layer":"original","quote":"遂诡道从郖津度","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":85,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":203,"end":210,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-fbe9acf14b201e7901fa","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-14e81f2c7c0e488327c7","layer":"original","quote":"上党诸县杀长吏，弘农执郡守","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":87,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":21,"end":34,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-fc6fe04d4f00af441fdd","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-18fc621e57fb0ca723bc","layer":"original","quote":"时河东太守王邑，被征","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":67,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":57,"end":67,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q2-2ef9c88b1dba8f58de2f","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-8c7df2fe9cdbb6e8ace6","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞郖，音豆。《魏略》曰：“初，畿与卫固少相狎侮，固尝轻畿。畿尝与固博而争道，畿尝谓固曰：‘仲坚，我今作河东也。’固褰衣骂之。及畿之官，而固为郡功曹。张时故任京兆。畿迎司隶，与时会华阴。时、畿相见，于仪当各持版。时叹曰：‘昨日功曹，今为郡将也！’”","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":110,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-4577dea79c580e58d10a","start":0,"end":125,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhonghua-q-1c92809c59c4ed26b372","section":"chapter-013","block":"b-6007847d1ec8e28149ac","layer":"pei","quote":"诏征河东太守王邑。邑以天下未定，心不愿征；而吏民亦恋邑，郡掾卫固及中郎将范先等，各诣繇求乞邑。而诏已拜杜畿为太守，畿已入界。繇不听先等，促邑交符。邑佩印绶，径从河北诣，自归。","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"钟繇华歆王朗传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0031.xhtml","index":46,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-7e5989b9f71152934b24","start":10,"end":97,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhonghua-q-4bed0765b0b21f7a220b","section":"chapter-013","block":"b-6ee93dddf14ade60e6ec","layer":"original","quote":"其后河东卫固作乱，与张晟、张琰及高幹等并为寇；繇又率诸将讨破之。","section_title":"钟繇华歆王朗传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0031.xhtml","index":21,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":228,"end":260,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
